#   node -e "import('@bkazemi/verily').then(async (v) => console.log(await v.generateSigningKey('verily.example.com')))"
# It is an armored OpenPGP private key of several lines, so put it in double quotes.
SIGNING_KEY=
EXAMPLE_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-long-local-password
